// Ensure JSDOM's base URL is HTTP (not file://) so absolute static asset paths
// (e.g. `/logo.svg`) resolve to `http://localhost/...` instead of `file:///...`.
// On Windows the `file:///` form can surface in source-maps and cause Node APIs
